---

<section aria-labelledby="avatars-heading" class="avatars">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="panel copy-panel">
      <h2 id="avatars-heading" class="h2">Build a face for the internet.</h2>
      <p class="body-large">
        Mix a look from scratch, piece by piece. Your avatar carries across chat, Reels, and streams.
      </p>
      <!--
        TODO(founder): licensed character avatars are on the roadmap. Do not
        add a licensed character's name or likeness here until the agreement
        is signed. Once signed, add: "Or step into a licensed character."
      -->
    </div>

    <figure class="panel media-panel">
      <!--
        TODO(founder), blocking — see spec §12 asset register:
        1. IP review: confirm the mocap capture demo doesn't recreate a
           licensed character's signature move before any cut of it ships
           here, and rename the source file away from the property name.
        2. Rights: confirm the mocap vendor's agreement actually licenses
           this footage for marketing use — a shared Drive file isn't a
           license.
        No source exists in this repo; this panel is a placeholder only.
      -->
      <div class="media-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="media-bg-pink"></div>
        <div class="media-bg-blue"></div>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .avatars {
    padding: 24px;
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .copy-panel {
    padding: 32px 24px;
  }

  .media-panel {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 280px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .media-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(192, 38, 211, 0.16), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2));
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .media-bg-pink,
  .media-bg-blue {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 500px;
    height: 420px;
    transform: rotate(-38.088deg);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 500px;
    filter: blur(60px);
    --orbit-radius: 120px;
  }
  .media-bg-pink {
    background: rgba(222, 11, 201, 0.3);
    animation: bg-circle-pink 24s linear infinite;
  }
  .media-bg-blue {
    background: rgba(18, 134, 240, 0.3);
    animation: bg-circle-blue 24s linear infinite;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .avatars {
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .copy-panel {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
